{"real": false, "dur": 85.31, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 4.63, "text": "This is where French and Chinese start to look quite different.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "is", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "where", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "French", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "and", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "start", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "to", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "look", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "quite", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "different.", "s": 4.25}]}, {"start": 4.98, "end": 9.98, "text": "I can keep the same exercise, but change what learners have to choose.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "can", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "keep", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "same", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "exercise,", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "but", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "change", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "what", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "learners", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "have", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "to", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "choose.", "s": 9.6}]}, {"start": 10.33, "end": 14.56, "text": "In French, at two stars, the key choice is the article.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "French,", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "at", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "two", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "stars,", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "the", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "key", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "choice", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "is", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "article.", "s": 14.18}]}, {"start": 14.91, "end": 17.6, "text": "You like yoga, so it takes “the.”", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "like", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "yoga,", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "so", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "it", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "takes", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "“the.”", "s": 17.22}]}, {"start": 17.95, "end": 20.65, "text": "You do yoga, so it takes “some.”", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "do", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "yoga,", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "so", "s": 19.11}, {"w": "it", "s": 19.49}, {"w": "takes", "s": 19.88}, {"w": "“some.”", "s": 20.26}]}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 23.3, "text": "Look at the two sentences here.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 21.0}, {"w": "at", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "two", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "sentences", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "here.", "s": 22.92}]}, {"start": 23.65, "end": 30.58, "text": "“The” versus “some” is exactly where beginners go wrong, so that’s the gap the learner has to fill.", "words": [{"w": "“The”", "s": 23.65}, {"w": "versus", "s": 24.04}, {"w": "“some”", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "is", "s": 24.81}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 25.19}, {"w": "where", "s": 25.58}, {"w": "beginners", "s": 25.96}, {"w": "go", "s": 26.35}, {"w": "wrong,", "s": 26.73}, {"w": "so", "s": 27.12}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 27.88}, {"w": "gap", "s": 28.27}, {"w": "the", "s": 28.65}, {"w": "learner", "s": 29.04}, {"w": "has", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "to", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "fill.", "s": 30.19}]}, {"start": 30.93, "end": 32.47, "text": "Mandarin has no articles.", "words": [{"w": "Mandarin", "s": 30.93}, {"w": "has", "s": 31.31}, {"w": "no", "s": 31.7}, {"w": "articles.", "s": 32.08}]}, {"start": 32.82, "end": 35.12, "text": "So what goes in the gap?", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 32.82}, {"w": "what", "s": 33.2}, {"w": "goes", "s": 33.58}, {"w": "in", "s": 33.97}, {"w": "the", "s": 34.35}, {"w": "gap?", "s": 34.74}]}, {"start": 35.47, "end": 39.7, "text": "In this example, it’s the verb that goes with the object.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 35.47}, {"w": "this", "s": 35.86}, {"w": "example,", "s": 36.24}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 36.63}, {"w": "the", "s": 37.01}, {"w": "verb", "s": 37.4}, {"w": "that", "s": 37.78}, {"w": "goes", "s": 38.17}, {"w": "with", "s": 38.55}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.93}, {"w": "object.", "s": 39.32}]}, {"start": 40.05, "end": 42.75, "text": "These all come from the first textbook.", "words": [{"w": "These", "s": 40.05}, {"w": "all", "s": 40.44}, {"w": "come", "s": 40.82}, {"w": "from", "s": 41.21}, {"w": "the", "s": 41.59}, {"w": "first", "s": 41.98}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 42.36}]}, {"start": 43.1, "end": 47.71, "text": "Look at these three examples: play ball, see a film, drink coffee.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 43.1}, {"w": "at", "s": 43.48}, {"w": "these", "s": 43.87}, {"w": "three", "s": 44.25}, {"w": "examples:", "s": 44.63}, {"w": "play", "s": 45.02}, {"w": "ball,", "s": 45.4}, {"w": "see", "s": 45.79}, {"w": "a", "s": 46.17}, {"w": "film,", "s": 46.56}, {"w": "drink", "s": 46.94}, {"w": "coffee.", "s": 47.33}]}, {"start": 48.06, "end": 51.14, "text": "The learner matches each verb to its object.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 48.06}, {"w": "learner", "s": 48.45}, {"w": "matches", "s": 48.83}, {"w": "each", "s": 49.22}, {"w": "verb", "s": 49.6}, {"w": "to", "s": 49.98}, {"w": "its", "s": 50.37}, {"w": "object.", "s": 50.75}]}, {"start": 51.49, "end": 54.18, "text": "Another good example is the measure word.", "words": [{"w": "Another", "s": 51.49}, {"w": "good", "s": 51.87}, {"w": "example", "s": 52.26}, {"w": "is", "s": 52.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.03}, {"w": "measure", "s": 53.41}, {"w": "word.", "s": 53.8}]}, {"start": 54.53, "end": 58.38, "text": "A piece of clothing takes the classifier you see here.", "words": [{"w": "A", "s": 54.53}, {"w": "piece", "s": 54.92}, {"w": "of", "s": 55.3}, {"w": "clothing", "s": 55.68}, {"w": "takes", "s": 56.07}, {"w": "the", "s": 56.45}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 56.84}, {"w": "you", "s": 57.22}, {"w": "see", "s": 57.61}, {"w": "here.", "s": 57.99}]}, {"start": 58.73, "end": 62.57, "text": "The typical beginner mistake is to use the general-purpose one.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 58.73}, {"w": "typical", "s": 59.11}, {"w": "beginner", "s": 59.5}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 59.88}, {"w": "is", "s": 60.27}, {"w": "to", "s": 60.65}, {"w": "use", "s": 61.03}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.42}, {"w": "general-purpose", "s": 61.8}, {"w": "one.", "s": 62.19}]}, {"start": 62.92, "end": 69.08, "text": "So I can reuse the same exercise format, but change the answer depending on the language.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 62.92}, {"w": "I", "s": 63.31}, {"w": "can", "s": 63.69}, {"w": "reuse", "s": 64.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.46}, {"w": "same", "s": 64.85}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 65.23}, {"w": "format,", "s": 65.62}, {"w": "but", "s": 66.0}, {"w": "change", "s": 66.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 66.77}, {"w": "answer", "s": 67.15}, {"w": "depending", "s": 67.54}, {"w": "on", "s": 67.92}, {"w": "the", "s": 68.31}, {"w": "language.", "s": 68.69}]}, {"start": 69.43, "end": 72.5, "text": "In French, “some” fits and “the” bounces off.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 69.43}, {"w": "French,", "s": 69.81}, {"w": "“some”", "s": 70.2}, {"w": "fits", "s": 70.58}, {"w": "and", "s": 70.97}, {"w": "“the”", "s": 71.35}, {"w": "bounces", "s": 71.73}, {"w": "off.", "s": 72.12}]}, {"start": 72.85, "end": 77.85, "text": "In Chinese, the classifier for clothing fits, and the general one bounces off.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 72.85}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 73.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 73.62}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 74.01}, {"w": "for", "s": 74.39}, {"w": "clothing", "s": 74.78}, {"w": "fits,", "s": 75.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 75.55}, {"w": "the", "s": 75.93}, {"w": "general", "s": 76.32}, {"w": "one", "s": 76.7}, {"w": "bounces", "s": 77.08}, {"w": "off.", "s": 77.47}]}, {"start": 78.2, "end": 84.36, "text": "Chinese also needs exercises for tones and characters, but these still fit into the same categories.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese", "s": 78.2}, {"w": "also", "s": 78.59}, {"w": "needs", "s": 78.97}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 79.36}, {"w": "for", "s": 79.74}, {"w": "tones", "s": 80.13}, {"w": "and", "s": 80.51}, {"w": "characters,", "s": 80.9}, {"w": "but", "s": 81.28}, {"w": "these", "s": 81.67}, {"w": "still", "s": 82.05}, {"w": "fit", "s": 82.43}, {"w": "into", "s": 82.82}, {"w": "the", "s": 83.2}, {"w": "same", "s": 83.59}, {"w": "categories.", "s": 83.97}]}]}